{
  "book": "jacob",
  "bookName": "Jacob",
  "chapter": 2,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 506.063,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.92,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The words which Jacob, the brother of Nephi, spake unto the people of Nephi, after the death of Nephi:",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 7.6,
      "end": 14.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, my beloved brethren, I, Jacob, according to the responsibility which I am under to God,",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 14.421,
      "end": 17.022,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to magnify mine office with soberness,",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 17.202,
      "end": 20.174,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that I might rid my garments of your sins,",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 20.354,
      "end": 22.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I come up into the temple this day",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 22.81,
      "end": 25.921,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might declare unto you the word of God.",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 26.601,
      "end": 31.384,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And ye yourselves know that I have hitherto been diligent in the office of my calling;",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 31.564,
      "end": 37.23,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I this day am weighed down with much more desire and anxiety for the welfare of your souls",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 37.41,
      "end": 39.221,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "than I have hitherto been.",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 39.901,
      "end": 43.012,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, as yet, ye have been obedient",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 43.192,
      "end": 46.257,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto the word of the Lord, which I have given unto you.",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 46.937,
      "end": 52.835,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, hearken ye unto me, and know that by the help of the all-powerful Creator of heaven and earth",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 53.015,
      "end": 55.198,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I can tell you concerning your thoughts,",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 55.378,
      "end": 58.072,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "how that ye are beginning to labor in sin,",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 58.252,
      "end": 61.085,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which sin appeareth very abominable unto me,",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 61.265,
      "end": 63.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and abominable unto God.",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 64.081,
      "end": 66.124,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, it grieveth my soul",
      "verse": "2:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 66.304,
      "end": 70.344,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and causeth me to shrink with shame before the presence of my Maker,",
      "verse": "2:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 70.524,
      "end": 74.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I must testify unto you concerning the wickedness of your hearts.",
      "verse": "2:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 75.476,
      "end": 77.148,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also it grieveth me",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 77.328,
      "end": 80.3,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I must use so much boldness of speech",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 80.48,
      "end": 83.545,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning you, before your wives and your children,",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 83.725,
      "end": 88.926,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "many of whose feelings are exceedingly tender and chaste and delicate before God,",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 89.106,
      "end": 91.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which thing is pleasing unto God;",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 92.015,
      "end": 96.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it supposeth me that they have come up hither to hear the pleasing word of God,",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 97.118,
      "end": 100.137,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the word which healeth the wounded soul.",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 100.817,
      "end": 108.572,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, it burdeneth my soul that I should be constrained, because of the strict commandment which I have received from God,",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 108.752,
      "end": 111.167,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to admonish you according to your crimes,",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 111.347,
      "end": 114.691,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to enlarge the wounds of those who are already wounded,",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 114.871,
      "end": 117.936,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "instead of consoling and healing their wounds;",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 118.116,
      "end": 120.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and those who have not been wounded,",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 120.246,
      "end": 123.729,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "instead of feasting upon the pleasing word of God",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 123.909,
      "end": 126.974,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "have daggers placed to pierce their souls",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 127.154,
      "end": 129.337,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and wound their delicate minds.",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 130.017,
      "end": 132.896,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But, notwithstanding the greatness of the task,",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 133.076,
      "end": 136.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I must do according to the strict commands of God,",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 136.275,
      "end": 142.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and tell you concerning your wickedness and abominations, in the presence of the pure in heart,",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 142.492,
      "end": 144.257,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the broken heart,",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 144.437,
      "end": 148.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and under the glance of the piercing eye of the Almighty God.",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 148.832,
      "end": 153.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I must tell you the truth according to the plainness of the word of God.",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 153.702,
      "end": 156.117,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, as I inquired of the Lord,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 156.297,
      "end": 158.851,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thus came the word unto me, saying:",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 159.031,
      "end": 162.096,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Jacob, get thou up into the temple on the morrow,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 162.276,
      "end": 165.991,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and declare the word which I shall give thee unto this people.",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 166.671,
      "end": 170.758,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, my brethren, this is the word which I declare unto you,",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 170.938,
      "end": 184.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that many of you have begun to search for gold, and for silver, and for all manner of precious ores, in the which this land, which is a land of promise unto you and to your seed,",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 184.864,
      "end": 187.047,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "doth abound most plentifully.",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 187.727,
      "end": 191.535,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the hand of providence hath smiled upon you most pleasingly,",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 191.715,
      "end": 194.13,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that you have obtained many riches;",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 194.31,
      "end": 197.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and because some of you have obtained more abundantly",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 197.462,
      "end": 199.32,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "than that of your brethren",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 199.5,
      "end": 202.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye are lifted up in the pride of your hearts,",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 202.42,
      "end": 208.086,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and wear stiff necks and high heads because of the costliness of your apparel,",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 208.266,
      "end": 210.309,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and persecute your brethren",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 210.489,
      "end": 213.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because ye suppose that ye are better than they.",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 214.327,
      "end": 215.627,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my brethren,",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 215.807,
      "end": 219.011,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "do ye suppose that God justifieth you in this thing?",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 219.191,
      "end": 221.234,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you, Nay.",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 221.414,
      "end": 223.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But he condemneth you,",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 223.219,
      "end": 225.262,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if ye persist in these things",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 225.442,
      "end": 228.182,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "his judgments must speedily come unto you.",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 228.862,
      "end": 231.323,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O that he would show you that he can pierce you,",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 231.503,
      "end": 235.125,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and with one glance of his eye he can smite you to the dust!",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 235.805,
      "end": 239.52,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O that he would rid you from this iniquity and abomination.",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 239.7,
      "end": 243.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And, O that ye would listen unto the word of his commands,",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 243.735,
      "end": 246.939,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and let not this pride of your hearts destroy your souls!",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 247.619,
      "end": 250.545,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Think of your brethren like unto yourselves,",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 250.725,
      "end": 252.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be familiar with all",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 252.809,
      "end": 254.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and free with your substance,",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 254.707,
      "end": 257.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may be rich like unto you.",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 257.848,
      "end": 260.031,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But before ye seek for riches,",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 260.211,
      "end": 262.208,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "seek ye for the kingdom of God.",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 262.888,
      "end": 265.535,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after ye have obtained a hope in Christ",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 265.715,
      "end": 268.362,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall obtain riches, if ye seek them;",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 268.542,
      "end": 271.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye will seek them for the intent to do good\u2014",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 271.787,
      "end": 273.459,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to clothe the naked,",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 273.639,
      "end": 275.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to feed the hungry,",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 275.491,
      "end": 277.488,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to liberate the captive,",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 277.668,
      "end": 281.29,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and administer relief to the sick and the afflicted.",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 281.97,
      "end": 283.27,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my brethren,",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 283.45,
      "end": 285.911,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have spoken unto you concerning pride;",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 286.091,
      "end": 288.97,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and those of you which have afflicted your neighbor,",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 289.15,
      "end": 290.822,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and persecuted him",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 291.002,
      "end": 293.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because ye were proud in your hearts,",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 293.597,
      "end": 296.198,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of the things which God hath given you,",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 296.378,
      "end": 297.818,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "what say ye of it?",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 298.498,
      "end": 303.049,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do ye not suppose that such things are abominable unto him who created all flesh?",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 303.229,
      "end": 306.758,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the one being is as precious in his sight as the other.",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 306.938,
      "end": 308.935,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And all flesh is of the dust;",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 309.115,
      "end": 312.134,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and for the selfsame end hath he created them,",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 312.314,
      "end": 315.936,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should keep his commandments and glorify him forever.",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 316.616,
      "end": 320.424,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I make an end of speaking unto you concerning this pride.",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 320.604,
      "end": 325.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And were it not that I must speak unto you concerning a grosser crime,",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 325.614,
      "end": 328.633,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my heart would rejoice exceedingly because of you.",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 329.313,
      "end": 332.75,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But the word of God burdens me because of your grosser crimes.",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 332.93,
      "end": 335.113,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, thus saith the Lord:",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 335.293,
      "end": 337.708,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "This people begin to wax in iniquity;",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 337.888,
      "end": 340.071,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they understand not the scriptures,",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 340.251,
      "end": 346.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they seek to excuse themselves in committing whoredoms, because of the things which were written concerning David,",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 347.118,
      "end": 348.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Solomon his son.",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 349.377,
      "end": 353.371,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, David and Solomon truly had many wives and concubines,",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 353.551,
      "end": 356.012,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which thing was abominable before me,",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 356.192,
      "end": 357.492,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord.",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 358.172,
      "end": 360.54,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, thus saith the Lord,",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 360.72,
      "end": 365.828,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have led this people forth out of the land of Jerusalem by the power of mine arm,",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 366.008,
      "end": 370.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might raise up unto me a righteous branch from the fruit of the loins of Joseph.",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 371.564,
      "end": 376.719,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I the Lord God will not suffer that this people shall do like unto them of old.",
      "verse": "2:26",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 377.399,
      "end": 379.535,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, my brethren, hear me,",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 379.715,
      "end": 381.758,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hearken to the word of the Lord:",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 381.938,
      "end": 385.839,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For there shall not any man among you have save it be one wife;",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 386.019,
      "end": 388.341,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and concubines he shall have none;",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 389.021,
      "end": 392.179,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I, the Lord God, delight in the chastity of women.",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 392.359,
      "end": 395.192,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And whoredoms are a abomination before me;",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 395.372,
      "end": 397.462,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thus saith the Lord of Hosts.",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 398.142,
      "end": 401.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, this people shall keep my commandments,",
      "verse": "2:29",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 401.573,
      "end": 403.198,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord of Hosts,",
      "verse": "2:29",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 403.378,
      "end": 405.746,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or cursed be the land for their sakes.",
      "verse": "2:29",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 406.426,
      "end": 407.68,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For if I will,",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 407.86,
      "end": 409.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord of Hosts,",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 409.665,
      "end": 411.43,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "raise up seed unto me,",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 411.61,
      "end": 413.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will command my people;",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 413.462,
      "end": 416.248,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "otherwise they shall hearken unto these things.",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 416.928,
      "end": 419.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, I, the Lord, have seen the sorrow,",
      "verse": "2:31",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 420.173,
      "end": 424.817,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and heard the mourning of the daughters of my people in the land of Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "2:31",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 424.997,
      "end": 432.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and in all the lands of my people, because of the wickedness and abominations of their husbands.",
      "verse": "2:31",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 433.061,
      "end": 434.547,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I will not suffer,",
      "verse": "2:32",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 434.727,
      "end": 436.352,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord of Hosts,",
      "verse": "2:32",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 436.532,
      "end": 439.643,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the cries of the fair daughters of this people,",
      "verse": "2:32",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 439.823,
      "end": 442.609,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which I have led out of the land of Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "2:32",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 442.789,
      "end": 446.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall come up unto me against the men of my people,",
      "verse": "2:32",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 446.313,
      "end": 448.078,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord of Hosts.",
      "verse": "2:32",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 448.758,
      "end": 454.191,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For they shall not lead away captive the daughters of my people because of their tenderness,",
      "verse": "2:33",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 454.371,
      "end": 459.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save I shall visit them with a sore curse, even unto destruction;",
      "verse": "2:33",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 459.241,
      "end": 461.47,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they shall not commit whoredoms,",
      "verse": "2:33",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 461.65,
      "end": 463.322,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "like unto them of old,",
      "verse": "2:33",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 463.502,
      "end": 465.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord of Hosts.",
      "verse": "2:33",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 465.947,
      "end": 470.963,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, my brethren, ye know that these commandments were given to our father, Lehi;",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 471.143,
      "end": 473.558,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, ye have known them before;",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 473.738,
      "end": 476.432,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye have come unto great condemnation;",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 476.612,
      "end": 480.188,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for ye have done these things which ye ought not to have done.",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 480.868,
      "end": 485.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, ye have done greater iniquities than the Lamanites, our brethren.",
      "verse": "2:35",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 485.553,
      "end": 488.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye have broken the hearts of your tender wives,",
      "verse": "2:35",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 488.473,
      "end": 492.978,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and lost the confidence of your children, because of your bad examples before them;",
      "verse": "2:35",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 493.158,
      "end": 496.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the sobbings of their hearts ascend up to God against you.",
      "verse": "2:35",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 496.728,
      "end": 499.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And because of the strictness of the word of God,",
      "verse": "2:35",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 499.787,
      "end": 502.202,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which cometh down against you,",
      "verse": "2:35",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 502.382,
      "end": 505.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "many hearts died, pierced with deep wounds.",
      "verse": "2:35",
      "lineIndex": 151
    }
  ]
}